DRAG HANDLE
====================================================

Add/use a small native-style drag handle at the top of the Settings sheet.

The handle should allow interactive vertical dragging.

When the user's finger moves down:

the entire Settings sheet follows the finger 1:1 vertically.

When the finger moves back up:

the sheet follows back upward.

No delayed movement.

No separate animation while the finger is still touching the screen.

